  "aboutDetectTitle": "Country detection",
  "aboutDetectBody": "On your tap, when the app opens and, only if you switched on “Check in the background”, in a background task, the app asks Android once for an approximate location and matches it against country borders stored inside the app (Natural Earth, public domain). Disputed territories are assigned to no country: on the map and in detection both sides are offered for you to choose; this is not the author’s position. Coordinates stay in memory only, are never saved and never sent anywhere; the app has no network access. Detection is only a suggestion: nothing changes until you confirm, correct or mark transit.",

