  "aboutTagline": "A private travel journal. It counts your days by country, shows the year in a calendar and on a map, and remembers where you were. Everything stays on your phone.",
  "aboutFeaturesTitle": "What it does",
  "aboutFeatCalendar": "Year calendar: every day painted with its country colour; transit and a day in two countries are marked separately.",
  "aboutFeatMap": "Country map and a rotating globe: visited countries in political-map colours, search that flies to a country.",
  "aboutFeatJournal": "Journal with search by country, city, note and year; a page for every country.",
  "aboutFeatPlans": "Trip plans: future dates show in the calendar but do not count until you confirm the trip.",
  "aboutFeatReview": "Year in review: countries and new countries, days, the longest trip, the map, cities, a picture to share.",
  "aboutFeatOnThisDay": "“On this day”: where you were on this date in past years.",
  "aboutFeatImport": "Google Maps Timeline import: countries are matched offline, you add only the periods you want.",
  "aboutFeatDetect": "Country detection on your tap and when the app opens: a suggestion that you confirm.",
  "aboutFeatBackup": "Backup as a single file, restore, “Clear everything” with confirmation.",
  "aboutContactTitle": "Contact",
  "aboutContactEmail": "Questions by email",
